  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every report in the suite has a three-dot menu for downloading it. On Technician Utilization the four options in that menu read Summary (PDF), Summary (CSV), Expanded (PDF) and Expanded (CSV)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "On the other reports the same four options begin with the word Download, and say Expanded View rather than Expanded. Technician Utilization is the odd one out."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Technician Utilization."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Leave every control at its default: date range This Year, All technicians, All locations."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Click the three-dot button, which is the leftmost of the buttons at the top right of the report, just before the column-selection button."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Read the four options in the menu word for word."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Now open Reports, then Sales By Customer, click its three-dot button and read its four options."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Compare the two lists."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Technician Utilization menu holds these four items, read off the screen: Summary (PDF), Summary (CSV), Expanded (PDF) and Expanded (CSV)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The word Download is missing from all four, and Expanded View has become Expanded. Sales By Customer and Sales By Representative both use the longer wording."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Technician Utilization menu uses the same wording as the other reports: Download Summary (PDF), Download Expanded View (PDF), Download Summary (CSV) and Download Expanded View (CSV)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Technician Utilization report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/641400833/Technician+Utilization+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 6, requirement S7-R2: \u201cThe menu has an option labeled \"Download Summary (PDF)\".\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The next two requirements in the same description say the same for the other options \u2014 S7-R3: \"The menu has an option labeled \u201cDownload Expanded View (PDF)\u201d.\" and S7-R4: \"The menu has an option labeled \u201cDownload Summary (CSV)\u201d.\" Every one begins with the word Download."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Chris Ward's answer in our questions spreadsheet",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1x8cuYJlFsDHalVZZTh156_ZCq2gcOaGY/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=106388879401921597782&rtpof=true&sd=true"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ": \u201cB) is correct here. Consistency is key.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "That answer is from the tab \"The product vs your write-up\", row 11, on 5 August 2026, where option B read: \"Bring it into line with Sales By Customer and Sales By Representative - the longer \u201cDownload \u2026\u201d wording.\" One honest caveat, about the number of options rather than their wording: the description names three options and the product ships four, and that count is still his to confirm."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
